iter 192 -- canonical cracking config + gap analysis
================================================================

CANONICAL FAITHFUL-WM PROVING CONFIG (post-commits f5a47081, fc319780,
0fb34573):

  THVM_HEAP_CELLS=$((1<<30)) \
  ATP_BENCH_ORD=lpo ATP_BENCH_LPO_SKOLEMS_HIGH=1 \
